            ['start_time'=>137,'end_time'=>139.54,'target_text'=>'Dude, they had like a smartwatch and they were just taking photos on it.','source_text'=>'Bro, mereka ada jam tangan pintar dan mereka ambil je gambar guna jam tu.','order'=>45],
