            ['start_time'=>1091.52,'end_time'=>1092.62,'target_text'=>'Because I don\'t need to think.','source_text'=>'Mak cuma duduk dan menikmati perjalanan meredah kesesakan lalu lintas.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1092.72,'end_time'=>1095.42,'target_text'=>'I could just, you know, whiz through the traffic.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya suasananya memang sangat mengasyikkan (a vibe).','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1095.52,'end_time'=>1096.7,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, it is a vibe though.','source_text'=>'Sebagai contoh, menaiki motosikal di bahagian belakang memang seronok kerana anda dapat menikmati pemandangan bandar','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1096.8,'end_time'=>1102.46,'target_text'=>'Like for example, them like riding on the back of those scooters is really fun cuz you just get to enjoy like the scenery','source_text'=>'dan suasana persekitaran sambil berada di udara terbuka.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1102.56,'end_time'=>1105.42,'target_text'=>'and everything around you and you get to be like outside.','source_text'=>'Tetapi jika anda menaiki teksi kereta biasa, anda tidak dapat merasai pengalaman itu sepenuhnya.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1105.52,'end_time'=>1109.98,'target_text'=>'But if you take a vehicle taxi inside a vehicle, you don\'t get to experience it as much.','source_text'=>'Ia terasa kurang asli (authentic).','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1110.08,'end_time'=>1113.48,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t feel like authent.','source_text'=>'Kali pertama mak naik memang berasa agak takut dan berhati-hati, tetapi sekarang mak yang ajak, \'Jom kita naik Grab Bike.\'','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1116.4,'end_time'=>1121.34,'target_text'=>'The first time I took it, I was cautious, but now I\'m like, let\'s grab a grab.','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang mak dah jadi profesional.','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>1121.44,'end_time'=>1122.7,'target_text'=>'>> Now you\'re a professional.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>494],
