            ['start_time'=>1168.16,'end_time'=>1171.18,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this is what the Fairmont looks like in Hanoi.','source_text'=>'>> Saya mahu anda semua menjawab soalan-soalan ini juga di ruangan komen.','order'=>519],
            ['start_time'=>1171.28,'end_time'=>1173.66,'target_text'=>'>> I want you guys to answer these questions as well.','source_text'=>'Apakah bahagian paling menyeronokkan bagi anda hari ini?','order'=>520],
            ['start_time'=>1173.76,'end_time'=>1177.26,'target_text'=>'What was your favorite part of the day?','source_text'=>'Mak boleh jawab dulu.','order'=>521],
