            ['start_time'=>195.36,'end_time'=>196.54,'target_text'=>'3,000.','source_text'=>'3,000.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>196.64,'end_time'=>204.3,'target_text'=>'That is the amount of words you need to understand up to 95% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'Itulah jumlah perkataan yang anda perlukan untuk memahami sehingga 95% pertuturan bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>204.4,'end_time'=>211.26,'target_text'=>'But if you want to keep improving after that, I\'ve now added the next 2,000 most common English words.','source_text'=>'Tetapi jika anda mahu terus meningkat selepas itu, saya kini telah menambah 2,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan yang seterusnya.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>211.36,'end_time'=>218.94,'target_text'=>'So you can build the full 5,000 word set and understand up to 98% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'Supaya anda dapat membina set lengkap 5,000 perkataan dan memahami sehingga 98% pertuturan bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>219.04,'end_time'=>228.54,'target_text'=>'So now you can start with the 3,000word PDF, continue with the next 2,000word PDF, or get both together is the full 5,000','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang anda boleh bermula dengan PDF 3,000 perkataan, sambung dengan PDF 2,000 perkataan, atau dapatkan kedua-duanya sekali untuk 5,000 perkataan lengkap','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>228.64,'end_time'=>236.38,'target_text'=>'most common English words PDF that will allow you to understand up to 98% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'PDF perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan yang membolehkan anda memahami sehingga 98% bahasa Inggeris lisan.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>236.48,'end_time'=>243.42,'target_text'=>'And in these new versions, there are now images as well to help you learn even faster.','source_text'=>'Dan dalam versi baharu ini, kini terdapat gambar juga untuk membantu anda belajar dengan lebih pantas.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>243.52,'end_time'=>253.02,'target_text'=>'Each PDF includes clear definitions, real examples, and simple organization to help you stop studying random words.','source_text'=>'Setiap PDF merangkumi definisi yang jelas, contoh sebenar, dan susunan ringkas untuk membantu anda berhenti belajar perkataan secara rawak.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>253.12,'end_time'=>257.26,'target_text'=>'And focus on the vocabulary that actually matters.','source_text'=>'Dan fokus pada kosa kata yang benar-benar penting.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>257.36,'end_time'=>262.12,'target_text'=>'You can get them from the link in the description or at vulca.com.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh mendapatkannya melalui pautan di bahagian penerangan atau di vulca.com.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>262.24,'end_time'=>271.5,'target_text'=>'I know uh last October or November uh before I went to Ecuador, I think he bought that packet and it was at home and I drank','source_text'=>'Saya tahu um Oktober atau November lalu um sebelum saya ke Ecuador, rasanya dia beli pek itu dan ada di rumah, lalu saya minum','order'=>79],
